name carbohydrates
category Package
revision 39000
shortdesc Carbohydrate molecules with chemfig
relocated 1
longdesc This package offers macros that make the preparation of
longdesc exercise sheets for teaching carbohydrate chemistry a lot less
longdesc tedious. It uses chemfig for drawing the formulas. Different
longdesc representation models (Fischer, Haworth, chair...) are
longdesc supported as well as alpha, beta, and chain isomers.
runfiles size=7
